e abort call was an abnormal termination. Hence, the only\nerror message you will receive is this one.\n\nThis may have caused other processes in the application to be\nterminated by signals sent by mpirun (as reported here).\n\nYou can avoid this message by specifying -quiet on the mpirun command line.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n[9f19dc7f1074:00026] PMIX ERROR: NOT-FOUND in file dstore_base.c at line 217\n[9f19dc7f1074:00026] PMIX ERROR: NO-PERMISSIONS in file dstore_base.c at line 246\n",  "tool_stdout": "",  "update_time": "2026-08-23T08:19:52.394084",  "user_email": "default-user@galaxyproject.org",  "user_id": "69540cdf4229a2b3" }, "output_problems": [  "Job in error state.. tool_id: toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu/repos/iuc/hyphy_fel/hyphy_fel/2.5.96+galaxy0, exit_code: 1, stderr: [9f19dc7f1074:00050] mca_base_component_repository_open: unable to open mca_btl_openib: librdmacm.so.1: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory (ignored)\n[9f19dc7f1074:00034] mca_base_component_repository_open: unable to open mca_btl_openib: librdmacm.so.1: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory (ignored)\n[9f19dc7f1074:00032] mca_base_component_repository_open: unable to open mca_btl_openib: librdmacm.so.1: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory (ignored)\n[9f19dc7f1074:00038] mca_base_component_repository_open: unable to open mca_btl_openib: librdmacm.so.1: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory (ignored)\n[9f19dc7f1074:00056] mca_base_component_repository_open: unable to open mca_btl_openib: librdmacm.so.1: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory (ignored)\n[9f19dc7f1074:00036] mca_base_component_repository_open: unable to open mca_btl_openib: librdmacm.so.1: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory (ignored)\n[9f19dc7f1074:00030] mca_base_component_repository_open: unable to open mca_btl_openib: librdmacm.so.1: cannot open shared 